{"4763450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Higher They Rise", "steam_appid": 4763450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to conquer a giant tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The Higher They Rise&quot;</strong> is a<strong> 3D Tactical Precision Platformer</strong> in which you challenge your fear of gravity on a rewarding, yet frustrating adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple paths and routes are available for you to explore on your journey to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hard to master. Feel your skill and speed increase as you gain mastery over the easy, yet precise controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim your hero, charge your jump and release to leap forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against gravity and yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can climb on anything you see and can reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple routes and shortcuts await you - higher risk=higher reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive recovery routes to minimize excessive frustration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various themed stages, mechanics and puzzles await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to conquer a giant tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The Higher They Rise&quot;</strong> is a<strong> 3D Tactical Precision Platformer</strong> in which you challenge your fear of gravity on a rewarding, yet frustrating adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple paths and routes are available for you to explore on your journey to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hard to master. Feel your skill and speed increase as you gain mastery over the easy, yet precise controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim your hero, charge your jump and release to leap forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against gravity and yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can climb on anything you see and can reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple routes and shortcuts await you - higher risk=higher reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive recovery routes to minimize excessive frustration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various themed stages, mechanics and puzzles await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "&quot;The Higher They Rise&quot; is a 3D Tactical Precision Platformer in which you challenge your fear of gravity. Multiple paths and routes are available for you to explore on your journey to the top. Aim your hero, charge your jump and release to leap forward. Fight against gravity and yourself!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763450/6cd70561e864139e63d6478eb76ef7eba486abae/header.jpg?t=1785065653", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763450/23fb648082a00b1ce0e00ea1544ee3ad449b915d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785065653", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763450/23fb648082a00b1ce0e00ea1544ee3ad449b915d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785065653", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-10100F or AMD Ryzen 3 3300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 or AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong